{"id":"uchest_","lemma":"учесть","pos":"verb","rank":4330,"glosses":["to take into account, to take into consideration, to appreciate (to be aware of)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e0/Ru-%D1%83%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D1%83%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"учту","2s":"учтёшь","3s":"учтёт","1p":"учтём","2p":"учтёте","3p":"учтут"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"учти","2p":"учтите"}}},"past":{"m":"учёл","p":"учли","f":"учла","n":"учло"},"aspect":"perfective","aspectPartner":"учитывать","examples":[{"text":"Я всё учёл.","en":"I've taken everything into consideration.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/180981","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"everything, all"},null]},{"text":"Ты должен это учесть.","en":"You have to take that into account.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"must, have to"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Пожалуйста, учти, что я сказал.","en":"Please bear in mind what I said.","words":[{"g":"please"},null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"}]},{"text":"Первое, что ты должен учесть, - время.","en":"The first thing you have to take into consideration is time.","words":[{"g":"the first thing"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"must, have to"},null,{"g":"time"}]},{"text":"Я это учту.","en":"I'll make a note of that.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]}]}